C03: the missing-name retry hint for a YouTube playback carries the playing state (VIDEO1719)

In VIDEO1717 the literal «abre youtube y pon un video» → «uno de gatos» played and verified, but its finals were vetoed: the first draft translated the title, and the retry hint («Cita el título completo tal cual se observó, entre comillas: «…»») produced the bare quoted title, which the state veto rejected before the third draft digressed. The hint now asks, in one sentence, to say that it is playing and to quote the whole title exactly as observed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


